---
description: UI changes must not break backend communication
alwaysApply: true
---

# UI ↔ backend sync

- When changing UI (especially lesson shell, prompt, stream consumers), verify the backend session/stream still connects.
- Do not ship UI refactors that drop event handlers, change payload shapes, or orphan API calls.
- After UI edits that touch data flow, smoke-check: prompt submit → API/SSE starts → events update UI.
- If the server communication path is unclear, trace it end-to-end before finishing.
